WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.568
The saved Week 16 plan calls for review of PR01–PR33, selected checklist and measurement readings, targeted remediation and a Mock OSCE with extensive documentation and formal handover. The saved Moodle Weekend 16 section has no lesson body or rubric.
保存的第16周计划要求复习PR01–PR33、指定核查表和测量阅读，进行针对性补强，并完成含详细记录与正式交接的模拟OSCE。已保存的Moodle第16周单元没有课程正文或评分表。

00:00:20.568 --> 00:00:34.752
This lesson supplies an original study structure for that plan. It is not AET courseware, a school checklist, a clinical sign-off, or permission to perform a procedure outside your certification and current service direction.
本课为该计划提供原创学习框架，不是AET官方课件、学校核查表、临床签核，也不授权你超出认证或现行服务指示执行操作。

00:00:34.752 --> 00:00:52.824
Keep the current BC Emergency Health Services procedure page open while reviewing. Record its identifier and revision date, then work through purpose, indication, prerequisites, authorization, sequence, stop criteria, expected response and documentation.
复习时应打开BCEHS现行操作页面，记录编号与修订日期，再依次核对目的、适应证、前提条件、授权、步骤、停止条件、预期反应和记录要求。

00:00:52.824 --> 00:01:06.096
Do not turn a title or a checklist item into a remembered technique. If the live guide and an older compilation differ, use the current service source and ask the instructor to resolve the school-copy mismatch.
不要把标题或核查表条目当成已经掌握的操作技巧。如果现行指南与旧汇编不一致，应以现行服务来源为准，并请教师厘清学校教材差异。

00:01:06.096 --> 00:01:26.760
Use the assigned glucose and cardiac-assessment readings to practise the reason behind a skill. A measurement is justified by the clinical question, not by the fact that it appears on a checklist. Explain what the result can and cannot tell you, what safety checks precede it and which actual authorized pathway guides the response.
用指定血糖及心脏评估阅读练习操作背后的理由。测量依据是临床问题，不是清单上有这一项。解释结果能与不能说明什么、之前有哪些安全检查，以及应按哪条实际获准路径响应。

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:50.280
The complete CPSC Appendix Two index contains eighty-nine entries, not eighty-nine fully taught procedure bodies. The CNS Appendix Two pointer remains unresolved and is not repaired by renaming the CPSC index. In a school drill, identify which real checklist you are using and do not improvise an unfamiliar step from a related title.
完整CPSC附录二目录有八十九条，不是八十九项完整操作正文。CNS附录二定位仍未解决，不能通过将CPSC目录改名补齐。学校练习应说明实际使用哪张清单，不能凭相关标题临时编出陌生步骤。

00:01:50.280 --> 00:02:13.008
Use the twelve VSM flashcards as retrieval prompts. Have a peer observe the technique before revealing the card, then compare your sequence and rationale with the source. A confident number is not evidence of a reliable measurement. Include the device fit, relevant positioning, signal quality and the reason to repeat or use another authorized method.
用VSM十二张闪卡作提取提示。先让同伴观察技术，再翻卡，对照来源核查顺序及理由。自信报数不证明测量可靠。应包括设备贴合、相关体位、信号质量，以及为何复测或采用另一获准方法。

00:02:13.008 --> 00:02:34.512
Make the difficulty specific: for example, the learner failed to recognize a poor fit, not simply failed vital signs. This is an original practice example, not a claim about your Appendix G. Repeat with one controlled variation, record the observed change and connect it to the patient consequence before increasing case complexity.
困难要具体，例如学习者没有识别贴合不佳，而不是笼统说生命体征不合格。这是原创练习例子，不是对你附录G的断言。以一个受控变量重复，记录观察变化并联系患者后果，再增加案例复杂度。

00:02:34.512 --> 00:02:50.616
The current PR set includes procedures that may be restricted to advanced providers or governed by separate requirements. A Week 16 review assignment does not mean every listed skill is in a PCP’s scope or must be performed during the school Mock OSCE.
现行PR集合中有些操作可能仅限高级执业层级，或另有专门要求。第16周要求复习，并不表示清单所有技能都属于PCP权限，也不表示这些操作都应在学校模拟OSCE中执行。

00:02:50.616 --> 00:03:18.360
The previously missing Pinel device teaching now uses actual manufacturer manuals together with the current service restraint policies. This is not recovery of the historical PR25 body. PR30 remains a resource collection with its actual checklist and pediatric method; a volumetric label returns a syringe manual. Learn the supplied bodies and preserve their limits instead of inventing a different algorithm.
此前缺失的Pinel器材教学现采用真实厂家手册及现行机构约束政策，但不等于恢复历史PR25正文。PR30仍按实际资源集、核查表和儿科方法讲授；体积泵标签返回注射泵手册。应学习真实正文并保留限制，而非编出另一算法。

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:35.640
The school plan links Week 16 remediation to learner-specific gaps. Start with a behavior that someone actually observed, not a vague label such as “be more confident.” Example: “I gave a handover but omitted the response to the last intervention.”
学校计划要求第16周补强应针对个人弱项。应从观察到的行为出发，而不是使用“更自信”之类模糊标签。例如：“我完成了交接，但漏报最近一次干预后的反应。”

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:47.880
The official Appendix G was not in the saved source set. This original gap-to-drill card helps prepare; it is not Appendix G and should not replace or be submitted instead of the school form.
已保存资料中没有官方Appendix G。本原创“弱项到练习”卡只用于准备，不是Appendix G，也不得代替学校表格提交。

00:03:47.880 --> 00:04:02.592
Choose a visible behavior and a reliable observer cue. For example, the observer can note whether you identified an unresolved risk, communicated it to the receiving clinician, and documented the patient’s response with a time reference.
选择可见行为和可靠的观察指标。例如，观察者可以记录你是否指出未解决风险、向接收临床人员传达，并用时间信息记录患者反应。

00:04:02.592 --> 00:04:16.080
Do not invent a pass score or a critical-fail rule. The BC Provincial Examination Guidelines describe the provincial licensing examination; they do not establish AET’s internal Mock OSCE scoring.
不要自行编造及格分数或一票否决规则。BC省考试指南描述的是省级执照考试，并不规定AET内部模拟OSCE的评分方式。

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:38.904
If a learner can recite a pressure technique but ignores an unreliable result in a case, the gap is transfer, not merely recall. Pair the relevant A&P or skills route with a short case cue, then observe whether the learner recognizes uncertainty and changes the plan appropriately. A second correct recitation alone does not answer that question.
学习者能背血压技术，却在案例中忽视不可靠读数时，弱项是迁移，不只是回忆。将对应A&P或技能路径配上简短案例线索，观察其能否识别不确定性并适当调整计划。再背对一次不能回答这个问题。

00:04:38.904 --> 00:05:01.824
Use the MSN evaluation loop to compare the intended learning behaviour with actual evidence. If the behaviour does not improve, examine the cue, instruction, equipment and feedback before merely adding repetitions. Save the next narrow target for supervised practice; do not turn an original coaching card into a completed official school form.
用MSN评价循环比较预期学习行为与实际证据。行为未改善时，应先检查线索、指导、设备和反馈，不只是增加次数。将下一项聚焦目标留给监督练习；不能把原创教练卡当成已完成学校官方表。

00:05:01.824 --> 00:05:26.832
The completed BC Provincial Examination Guidelines reading distinguishes the school’s saved twenty-twenty-five copy, its literal assigned pages, the body reached by the named grading topic and the later twenty-twenty-six comparison. Provincial scoring and official-result review are licensing processes. They do not automatically define an AET practice station or a school appeal procedure.
完整BCPEG阅读区分学校保存的2025副本、字面指定页、具名评分主题正文及后续2026对照版。省级评分与正式结果复核属于执照流程，不会自动定义AET练习站点或学校申诉程序。

00:05:26.832 --> 00:05:46.464
For the Mock OSCE, follow the instructor’s actual station instructions and feedback. The available school plan specifies extensive documentation and formal handover but supplies no numeric rubric. Ask the instructor to clarify any pass or fail criterion before treating it as official.
模拟OSCE应遵循教师实际发布的站点说明和反馈。现有学校计划要求详细记录与正式交接，但没有提供数值评分表。将任何及格标准视为官方要求前，应向教师确认。

00:05:46.464 --> 00:06:00.432
A useful teach-back is short, specific and traceable to a source. If you cannot identify the current page, role boundary or expected reassessment, reopen the material rather than filling the gap from memory.
有效的复述应简短、具体并能追溯来源。如果你说不出当前页面、执业边界或预期复评内容，就重新查阅材料，不要凭记忆填补空白。

00:06:00.432 --> 00:06:12.000
After the school station, separate what you observed, what the instructor said and what you infer. Keep the next drill narrow enough that one behavior can be practised and measured.
学校站点结束后，应区分亲眼观察到的事实、教师给出的反馈和自己的推断。下一次练习应足够聚焦，便于练习并衡量单一行为。
